  "title": "Diri ak Djon Djon (Haitian Black Mushroom Rice)",
  "description": "This diri ak djon djon (Haitian black mushroom rice) recipe is spicy, boldly flavored, filling, and so good. Serve it with boiled plantains (bannann peze).",
  "authors": [
    "Calixtes Bon Vivre"
